# UI Components Rule: shadcn/ui

This project uses [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) for all UI elements.

## Initialization
- If `shadcn/ui` is not already initialized, run:

  ```bash
  npx shadcn@latest init
  ```
- Presence of a `components.json` file indicates `shadcn/ui` is initialized. If it exists, do not re-run `init`.

## Component Usage
- If a particular shadcn/ui component is missing from the project, install it with:

  ```bash
  npx shadcn@latest add <component>
  ```
  For example, to install the Button component:
  ```bash
  npx shadcn@latest add button
  ```

## References
- [components.json](mdc:components.json)
- [package.json](mdc:package.json)

**Never use other libraries for UI elements.**